Package: myman
Type: Package
Title: Draw from Sequence of 'My Man' Posts by Kevin Kruse
Version: 0.12.0
Date: 2026-10-18
Authors@R: person("Dirk", "Eddelbuettel", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "edd@debian.org",
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6419-907X"))
Description: Starting on the afternoon of July 17, 2026, Kevin Kruse fired off an astonishing
 array of 'BlueSky' replies to an initial post of his featuring a certain government figure:
 <https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:cnpe7qvcyjrhm6w7w7e4atur/post/3mqum4mxsuk2g>. This lasted a
 week and generated nearly seven hundred posts. Over the next few weeks, several more waves
 followed, each taking aim at a different prominent figure. All of the by now over two thousand
 posts from these series start with 'My man ...' and make for excellent input to a 'fortunes'-like
 function. So this small package obliges and offers a random draw each time its myman() function
 is called.  The overall package structure follows package 'fortunes', and 'atrrr' was used to
 (bulk-)retrieve posts. Neither package is required to run this package to display random
 selections.
URL: https://github.com/eddelbuettel/myman
BugReports: https://github.com/eddelbuettel/myman/issues
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
